			},
			"date": "2026-10-21T15:18:32.333Z",
			"content": "<p>every time I get mad I have to edit frontmatter or whatever I remember that at any point in time four trillion bots are bouncing off of my site like water off a very poorly coded duck's back</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
