			},
			"date": "2026-10-21T15:35:52.576Z",
			"content": "<p>Same thought today. Every server runtime you don't run is one less emergency patch. Even for apps that need a backend, keeping the marketing and docs pages static shrinks what you have to patch tonight.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
