			"date": "2026-10-21T19:24:46.969Z",
			"content": "<p>I think the underrated part is where the risk moves. With static output, a vulnerable dependency lives in the build rather than on a running server, so patching becomes a rebuild and a deploy instead of a scramble to find out what was exposed.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
